  "ingredients": [
    "1 pound fresh shrimp, peeled, deveined and finely minced",
    "0.5 medium yellow onion, minced",
    "0.5 cup finely chopped water chestnuts",
    "0.5 cup finely chopped celery",
    "1 green onion, finely chopped",
    "0.5 cup cooked crabmeat",
    "1 large egg, beaten",
    "1.5 tablespoons chopped fresh parsley",
    "1 teaspoon sesame oil",
    "1 teaspoon minced garlic",
    "5 drops soy sauce",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "0.25 cup soy sauce",
    "3 tablespoons chopped fresh parsley",
    "1 tablespoon water",
    "1 teaspoon sesame oil",
    "1 teaspoon white sugar",
    "0.25 teaspoon garlic powder, or to taste",
    "2 cups oil for frying",
    "8 thick slices white bread"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/s2KI3ROtaFb4gW3r392_pY2VYho=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25870-Daddys-Shrimp-Toast-step-1-107-1429cd73a31a4f45b86ca2289da393be.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25870/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the shrimp paste: Mix shrimp, onion, water chestnuts, celery, and green onion together in a mixing bowl. Stir in crabmeat, egg, parsley, sesame oil, garlic, soy sauce, salt, and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/obD13efidGCPheYiqrJ9vm_JHS0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25870-Daddys-Shrimp-Toast-step-3-109-0c13ee63f835462aa162d71cc56d7b0f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25870/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the dipping sauce: Whisk soy sauce, parsley, water, sesame oil, sugar, and garlic powder together in a small bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BJ-V8UO8RvK8M7tQXSvk1ql8hxI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25870-Daddys-Shrimp-Toast-step-4-111-8862c451019142f99a403a0158692189.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25870/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the toast: Heat 1/2 inch oil in a large, heavy skillet over medium heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread each slice bread with a thick layer of shrimp paste, pressing gently so it sticks to bread.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9ezbeXzgYjxjf1PxNNXuUAFBJoA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25870-Daddys-Shrimp-Toast-step-5-112-1186522d8a094cc8b69ad700b492427b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25870/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Working in batches, fry bread, paste-side down, in hot oil until golden and shrimp is pink, 2 to 3 minutes. Flip carefully and cook until bread is golden brown, about 1 minute. Drain on paper towels.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vpkavacTx21a7lv1_z_NqU0xpRk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25870-Daddys-Shrimp-Toast-step-7-2-211-aa52b1e1f25643688e0fb3690dcc3cd9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25870/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice shrimp toasts diagonally and serve with dipping sauce.",
